                                "sense_id": "d9ec869e-cdf8-3d27-b142-72dd6871b300",
                                "text": "His steps were imperceptibly led almost in a circle; nor did he observe that he was on the verge of a tract of land heavily timbered, but not with pine-trees."
                            },
