                                "example_id": "87423d70-6ce2-4490-aa11-2907f7edbb9b",
                                "sense_id": "d9ec869e-cdf8-3d27-b142-72dd6871b300",
                                "text": "It [the Platte River] is destitute of timber along its banks, but there are here and there islands which are well timbered."
